    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "The triangle $ABC$ has vertices $A(1,6)$, $B(1,10)$ and $C(a,8)$. The area of $\\triangle ABC$ is 16. Find the possible values of $a$.",
    "layout": "list",
