        ]
      },
      "worked": "$AB$ is vertical on the line $x=1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}AB&=10-6\\\\AB&=4.\\end{align*}$$\nLet $h$ be the perpendicular distance from $C$ to $AB$.\n$$\\begin{align*}16&=\\frac12\\times4\\times h\\\\16&=2h\\\\h&=8.\\end{align*}$$\nThe point $C$ lies 8 units to the right or left of $x=1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}a&=1+8\\quad\\text{or}\\quad a=1-8\\\\a&=9\\quad\\text{or}\\quad a=-7.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
